# expected failures on a glibc Linux host (tests/run-gcc-torture.sh native, with
# tests/gcc-torture.x86_64-linux.xfail). The host's cc is gcc there, which accepts
# GNU extensions clang rejects, so these tests apply only on such a host: on
# macOS and FreeBSD clang skips them (or fails them too, for the gcc-only semantics).
